    "detailed_description": "<i>Scoops: A Story of Samples</i> is a high-speed minigame collection where you play games to make ice cream!<br><br>Opening up an ice cream shop after the worst of a pandemic certainly has its challenges. The flavors you serve and the people you serve them to are both vastly different. Get to know your customers through the ice cream you serve them, playing through retro arcade-style minigames to grant them the perfect treat they deserve, and experience a small sample of their lives! Also, you get to play as a penguin!<br><br>It's time for your story to unwind, one scoop at a time!",
